{"char_end":239,"char_start":32,"chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","dataset_version":"","doc_id":"doc_35cde4baed5e2e926dea","location":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选） / 1. 产品概述","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"温 保","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905248},{"anchor_text":"机 组","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905248},{"anchor_text":"护 。","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_610678f203d4ca30b32b","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10619191051905248}],"boundary_note":"","chunk_params":{},"chunking":"heading_window","clean_version":"","identity":{"dosage_form":"","generic_name":"","strength":"","version":""},"offset_origin":32,"source_group":"sample_manual"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_family_id":"","source_hash":"f466dc785004d95073ac8aeebad80649f8a4e06545a2941822f647ecc7bb8ee8","text":"智联 TCU-900 温控机组用于精密产线的循环冷却与过温保护。机组由冷媒回路、循环水泵、控制主板与远程告警模块组成。额定冷却能力为 9.0 kW，工作电源为三相 AC 380 V / 50 Hz。出厂默认将过温保护阈值设置为 65℃，用户可在 45℃ 至 80℃ 之间调整。\n\n本手册覆盖启动前检查、日常运行、过温告警处理与月度维护。操作人员须持有设备主管部门颁发的特种设备作业证，且在近 12 个月内完成复训。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","1. 产品概述"],"token_count":155,"tokenizer_id":"approx-v1"}
{"char_end":486,"char_start":267,"chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","dataset_version":"","doc_id":"doc_35cde4baed5e2e926dea","location":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选） / 2. 系统架构 / 2.1 模块划分","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"水 温","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.15064935045118108},{"anchor_text":"温 度","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.11877367827310145},{"anchor_text":"切 断","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_3a10854a4454c69c67da","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10043290030078739}],"boundary_note":"","chunk_params":{},"chunking":"heading_window","clean_version":"","identity":{"dosage_form":"","generic_name":"","strength":"","version":""},"offset_origin":267,"source_group":"sample_manual"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_family_id":"","source_hash":"f466dc785004d95073ac8aeebad80649f8a4e06545a2941822f647ecc7bb8ee8","text":"控制主板型号为 CMC-12B，负责采集出水温度、回水温度与压缩机电流。远程告警模块型号为 ALM-04，通过 RS-485 接入厂级监控，波特率固定为 9600。循环水泵额定流量 4.5 m³/h，扬程 18 m。冷媒回路使用 R134a，禁止混用其他工质。\n\n当控制主板检测到出水温度连续 8 秒高于保护阈值，会向 ALM-04 发送过温告警帧，同时切断压缩机接触器 KM1。切断后水泵继续运行不少于 120 秒，以便带走换热器余热。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","2. 系统架构","2.1 模块划分"],"token_count":153,"tokenizer_id":"approx-v1"}
{"char_end":590,"char_start":502,"chunk_id":"chk_97e7e2b30c2d5fcd4fd9","dataset_version":"","doc_id":"doc_35cde4baed5e2e926dea","location":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选） / 2. 系统架构 / 2.2 人机界面","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"表 示","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_97e7e2b30c2d5fcd4fd9","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.21193509204907346},{"anchor_text":"色 常","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_97e7e2b30c2d5fcd4fd9","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.14129006136604896},{"anchor_text":"常 亮","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_97e7e2b30c2d5fcd4fd9","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.14129006136604896}],"boundary_note":"","chunk_params":{},"chunking":"heading_window","clean_version":"","identity":{"dosage_form":"","generic_name":"","strength":"","version":""},"offset_origin":502,"source_group":"sample_manual"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_family_id":"","source_hash":"f466dc785004d95073ac8aeebad80649f8a4e06545a2941822f647ecc7bb8ee8","text":"面板设有运行、告警、故障三色指示灯。绿色常亮表示正常制冷；黄色闪烁表示过温告警尚未复位；红色常亮表示硬件故障，必须停机检修。人机界面禁止在压缩机启动后 30 秒内修改保护阈值。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","2. 系统架构","2.2 人机界面"],"token_count":77,"tokenizer_id":"approx-v1"}
{"char_end":786,"char_start":605,"chunk_id":"chk_ca4015e85c1598bdfac9","dataset_version":"","doc_id":"doc_35cde4baed5e2e926dea","location":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选） / 3. 启动前检查","metadata":{"anchors":[{"anchor_text":"检 查","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_ca4015e85c1598bdfac9","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.12802741477530502},{"anchor_text":"确 认","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_ca4015e85c1598bdfac9","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10825769455695758},{"anchor_text":"环 境","anchor_type":"keyword","chunk_id":"chk_ca4015e85c1598bdfac9","position_in_chunk":0,"score":0.10825769455695758}],"boundary_note":"","chunk_params":{},"chunking":"heading_window","clean_version":"","identity":{"dosage_form":"","generic_name":"","strength":"","version":""},"offset_origin":605,"source_group":"sample_manual"},"source_doc":"智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","source_family_id":"","source_hash":"f466dc785004d95073ac8aeebad80649f8a4e06545a2941822f647ecc7bb8ee8","text":"每次启动前必须完成下列检查：\n\n1. 确认冷却塔补水阀处于开启状态，水箱液位不低于最低刻度线。\n2. 检查散热通道无堵塞，过滤网压差不超过 150 Pa。\n3. 确认急停按钮已复位，KM1 与 KM2 触点无粘连。\n4. 记录环境温度。若环境温度低于 5℃，应先启用曲轴箱加热 15 分钟。\n\n未完成启动前检查不得合闸。违反该规程导致的压缩机液击不在质保范围内。","title_path":["智联工业温控机组操作手册（节选）","3. 启动前检查"],"token_count":137,"tokenizer_id":"approx-v1"}
